A||N||1||Elenor84||How do I make a signiture?||||1||
Z||000000||Elenor84||01-27-2001||05:06 AM||||I'm sure its been asked before but were on earth do I change my signiture...and how do I get a picture on it?  thx!<P>------------------<BR>Lance||||reg||1
Z||000001||Seanh||01-27-2001||10:08 AM||||To edit your sig. you go to "Profile" up in the top right hand corner of most PFF pages. Click it and "Submit your name and pass". Then once your on that page, go down to the bottem where your sig box is, and change it to what ever you want. <P>To put a pic in it, you have to have the pic uploaded on the net, somwhere. (Make sure it is a small one, dont take up the whole page) then find the address of it, and type it in, "ttp://www.whateveraddress.com/imagefile.gif" then put "[IMG]" in front of the address, no spaces, and "[/IMG]" behind it, again no spaces. Also, you dont use the " " markes. Then try it out. Email me if your still confused.<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/transsig.gif">     <BR><A HREF="http://www.kdsi.net/~sean" TARGET=_blank>Sean's Fiero Page</A><BR>Sean Heberly<BR>Silver 86 GT 2.8 Auto (3.4 Conversion in Progress)<BR><I>"It's always in the last place you look." Of course it is. Why would you keep looking after you've found it? Do people do this? Who and where are they?</I><p>[This message has been edited by Seanh (edited 01-27-2001).]||||reg||1
